sequenceDiagram
    participant Browser
    participant API as API Gateway + Lambda
    participant Raw as Raw S3
    participant Resizer as Resizer Lambda
    participant Output as Processed S3 / CloudFront
    Browser->>API: Create resize job
    API-->>Browser: Job ID and pre-signed URL
    Browser->>Raw: Upload image
    Raw->>Resizer: Object-created event
    Resizer->>Output: Store transformed image
    Browser->>API: Poll status
    API-->>Browser: Download path
